      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "<p>Plunge through dark chasms, outrace a ferocious beast and churn through raging, roiling currents on a thrilling raft adventure!</p>",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "A rafting expedition takes an unexpected turn. Now hang on tight as you plunge through deep, dark chasms, outrace a ferocious beast and churn through powerful currents!\n<!--<br><br>\n<strong>Get a Disney Standby Pass to help reduce wait times and arrange your park visit with ease with a tap of your finger!</strong>\n<br>\nDisney Standby Pass is required to experience Roaring Rapids <strong>from 10:30 to 15:30 today</strong>. \n<br>\nDisney Standby Pass is subject to availability.\n<br>\nOutside of these hours, Disney Standby Pass is not required to enter the queue for the attraction.-->"
      },
      "entityCards": [
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Confront the Mountain’s Terrifying Secret",
              "text": "<p>Join a rafting expedition to explore an ancient legend… but beware the dangers that lie ahead.</p>\n<p>You’re invited to join the League of Adventurers as they unravel the mystery of Adventure Isle’s highest peak, known as “Roaring Mountain” for the forbidding sounds it emits.</p>\n<p>Arbori natives believe that Q’aráq—a crocodile-like beast—dwells within. But could this incredible tale be true? League scientists have already unearthed fascinating relics and a hidden pathway.</p>\n<p>Finding more clues will require a perilous river journey through uncharted waters. Brave volunteers are needed. If you have a thirst for adventure and a yearning for excitement, climb aboard and set off into the unknown.</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-roaring-rapids-01_tcm1871-102770.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Feel the Rush! ",
              "text": "<p>A journey to explore becomes an adrenaline-charged race to survive.</p>\n<p>You’ll board your raft and set off upriver to Field Camp Beta. But look out! A fallen tree blocks your way and diverts the current in a new direction—right inside the mountain!</p>\n<p>Within the cavern, the roar turns deafening as the rapids propel you toward the enraged monster itself. Speeding through the darkness, you’ll see the bulging-eyed beast ahead, feel its steamy breath and duck as it snaps its giant razor-sharp teeth.</p>\n<p>If your raft escapes the fearsome jaws of Q’aráq, you’ll plunge through a lava tube and into a churning whirlpool, then past erupting volcanic vents and steaming geysers as the whitewater rapids sweep you back to basecamp.</p>\n<p>Breathlessly returning, you’ll be hailed by your fellow League of Adventurers members. Your mission has boldly embraced their intrepid spirit: seeking the unknown and discovering the unbelievable—no matter the peril!</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-roaring-rapids-02_tcm1871-102771.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
